    - Alexander Graham Bell
    - Nikola Tesla
    correctAnswer: Thomas Edison
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3af9fe927f15a754ead82b987151a8a1, type: 3}
    sentenceWithBlank: What star is at the center of our solar system?
    completedSentence: Sun
