    - Euro
    - Dollar
    correctAnswer: Yen
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 56bf3022cc1b8fc4cb09ecaf9f16ff41, type: 3}
    sentenceWithBlank: What instrument measures atmospheric pressure?
    completedSentence: Barometer
